# A block selection survives a quick add, so x afterwards completes the selected blocks, not the new one.
file <<END
INBOX: @inbox
Work:
	- One
	- Two
END
keys j j <S-Down>
keys q
type Three
keys <Enter> x
quit
saved <<END
INBOX: @inbox
	- Three
Work:
	- One @done({today})
	- Two @done({today})
END
